{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一架貨車在彩虹邨附近出事翻側，司機受傷清醒送院。</p><p></p><p>貨車橫臥三條行車線，車頭嚴重損毀，前車軸及車胎飛脫。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.WTS-0630_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026h0YJCSEmlx1792537717.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>警方指凌晨四時許，涉事貨車沿太子道東向觀塘方向行駛，至彩虹邨對開時撞向路中央的防撞欄後翻側Z。</p><p></p><p>45歲男司機手、腳及背部受傷，由救護員送院治理。事故原因有待警方調查。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.WTS-0630_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026VZvq2jyLoe1792537715.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T23:20:18.863860+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T02:57:57.217214+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T23:18:09.450123+00:00","content_hash":"d1aefb0128b49c147544e6b8cf88711c492f54a42d258daaf2d454e6da3ab87d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}